  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint:\r\n$\\mathrm{n}=3$ and $\\mathrm{I}=2$ means $3 \\mathrm{~d}$ -orbital. Since five orientations of $\\mathrm{d}$ -orbitals are degenerate, $\\mathrm{m}=-1$ can be assigned to any one. For maximum number of electrons as asked, answer should be atomic number 30.",
